      "severity": "must",
      "text": "The status describes SQLite’s column-rename procedure as implemented, but the missing `renameFixQuotes` operation lets renaming `a` to `z` change a stored `SELECT \"z\" FROM t` from a string literal into a column reference when double-quoted strings are enabled. Fix: document the required literal normalization and mark this behavior incomplete until implemented."
